'''Widowmaker''' is a [[Sub-Roles#Sharpshooter|Sharpshooter]] [[Roles#Damage|Damage]] [[Heroes|hero]] in ''[[Overwatch 2|Overwatch]]''. She is one of the 21 heroes included in the game's release on 24 May 2016.

==Overview==
[[File:Widowmaker HS.mp4|left|thumb]] Widowmaker equips herself with whatever it takes to eliminate her targets, including mines that dispense poisonous gas, a visor that grants her squad infra-sight, and a powerful sniper rifle that can fire in fully-automatic mode.

